@startuml organization-concept
title Organization Concept ; per ADR-ES-022 + CR-ES-022

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

class "Organization" as Org {
  +organizational_intent
  +actor_scope
  +role_scope
  +responsibility_scope
  +authority_context
  +resource_scope
  +activity_scope
  +policy_context
  +constraint_context
  +governance_context
  +accountability_context
  +organizational_outcome_scope
  +escalation_boundary
}

class "Organizational Intent" as OI
class "Actor" as A
class "Role" as R
class "Responsibility" as Resp
class "Authority" as Auth
class "Resource" as Res
class "Activity" as Act
class "Policy" as Pol
class "Constraint" as Con
class "Governance" as Gov
class "Accountability" as Acct
class "Organizational Outcome" as OO
class "Escalation Boundary" as EB

Org --> OI : pursues
Org --> A : coordinates
Org --> R : allocates
Org --> Resp : allocates
Org --> Auth : delegates
Org --> Res : marshals
Org --> Act : undertakes
Org --> Auth : operates-within
Org --> Pol : governed-by
Org --> Con : constrained-by
Org --> Gov : operates-under
Org --> Acct : accountable-under
Org --> OO : produces
Org --> EB : escalates-through

note right of Org
  Foundational concept per ADR-ES-022 section 1.
  Resolves the Foundational Dependency Gate documented in
  ADR-ES-020 section 2.
end note

@enduml
